Upstream provenance
-------------------

Poptart's earlier codebase was derived from Handy by CJ Pais. That codebase,
and its development history, is archived as:

    https://github.com/Playground-Labs/poptart-legacy

The Swift redesign in this repository is a clean break (ADR 0001) and carries
no Handy architecture forward. LICENSE retains CJ Pais's copyright notice
to preserve that provenance (ADR 0001, ADR 0031).


